Feature: Booking a stay at Haven & Pine

  @smoke @journey
  Scenario: A guest books a room end to end
    StepSet Search for a two-night stay
    StepSet Choose the Garden Queen with breakfast
    StepSet Fill in the lead guest details
    When I add the special request
      """
      Late arrival around 22:00, please keep the room.
      """
    And I continue to payment
    StepSet Pay with the demo card
    When I accept the booking terms
    And I confirm the booking and wait for the bookings API to return 201
    And I open My Booking
    Then I should see "Paid in full"
    And the booking reference should be "HP-LOV-2701"
    And the special request should be shown
    And the bookings request should have returned 201

  @pricing
  Scenario: The booking summary adds 12% tax to the stay
    StepSet Search for a two-night stay
    StepSet Choose the Garden Queen with breakfast
    Then the booking summary should show taxes of "€51.12"
    And the booking summary total should be "€477.12"
